#: src/onboarding.py:478
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat Gesiichtsauthentif"
"ikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardwar"
"e TPM 2.0 aktiv. Äert Passwuert gëtt sécher am TPM versiegelt."

#: src/onboarding.py:480
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat Gesiichtsauthentif"
"ikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM Har"
"dware entdeckt, awer automatesch Installatioun vun <i>tpm2-tools</i> a"
"ss gescheitert. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falen zr"
"éck op Software-baséiert Umeldungscaching."

#: src/onboarding.py:482
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Ären {} automatesch opmaachen mat Gesiichtsauthentif"
"ikatioun (detektéiert Portemonnaie: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Keng TP"
"M Hardware fonnt. Benotzt Software-baséiert Umeldungscaching (AES-256-"
"GCM)."

