#: src/main.glade:440
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéiert Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun fir automatesch Äre Login Schlës"
"selring oder KWallet beim Login opzemaachen. Dëst späichert Äert Passw"
"uert sécher am TPM versiegelt wann et verfügbar ass, oder verschlëssel"
"t mat AES-256-GCM mat engem root-nëmmen Master-Schlëssel. Face Auth se"
"tzt PAM_AUTHTOK fir pam_gnome_keyring oder pam_kwallet5 ofhängeg vun Ä"
"rem Desktop."

